      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Analytics Services - Exports Schema",
      "Anchor": "analytics-services---exports-schema",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This article explains format and schema of the data that is exported from Analytics Services APIs.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Analytics Services - Exports Schema",
      "Anchor": "analytics-services---exports-schema",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Exports are CSV files that contain all rows available for the interval requested in the export job. Exports can be performed for activities, activity outcomes, and seats. CSV schemas for each export are defined below. For more information on how to create export jobs to export data, see Exporting User Activity.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Analytics Services - Exports Schema",
      "Anchor": "analytics-services---exports-schema",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Activity CSV Schema\nActivityOutcome CSV Schema\nSeats CSV Schema",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
